}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sigma01Class}(U)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sigma01Class}(U)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b73290a0af01d44f\" href=\"?note=b73290a0af01d44f\" title=\"20-df-closed-class\">20-df-closed-class</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"755e421576224435\" href=\"?note=755e421576224435\" title=\"20-df-strings\">20-df-strings</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}effective-prefix-free-cover}\\vdash\n\\exists P\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\\ [\\operatorname{code}[P]\\in\\mathcal E\\land\\forall\\sigma\\ne\\tau\\in P\\ \\sigma\\perp\\tau\\land U=\\bigcup_{\\sigma\\in P}[\\sigma]].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}effective-prefix-free-cover}\\vdash\n\\exists P\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\\ [\\operatorname{code}[P]\\in\\mathcal E\\land\\forall\\sigma\\ne\\tau\\in P\\ \\sigma\\perp\\tau\\land U=\\bigcup_{\\sigma\\in P}[\\sigma]].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>逐项枚举一个给定开覆盖。出现新柱 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\sigma]\">\\([\\sigma]\\)</span> 时，从它减去已经输出的有限多个互不相交柱；该 clopen 差集可有效细分为有限个互不相交柱，输出这些新串。它们与旧串及彼此不相容。每次并集恰好增加新柱未覆盖的部分，极限并集等于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span>。不必判断某条已枚举串是否永远是最短覆盖串。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 11.3.2 的前缀自由表示补写；印刷页 192；PDF 第 223 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-closed-class","status":"resolved","id":"b73290a0af01d44f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-closed-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-strings"